     1060   on choose of b-mark in frame fr-D-rattr-0 do:
     1061     if available buf_c-trn-rsn-attr then do:
     1062   define variable vss-include-info8 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1063   define variable v-str-recid9 as character no-undo .
