     1135     display
     1136     sch-code
     1137     with frame fr-D-rattr-0.
     1138   end.
     1139   on leave of sch-code in frame fr-D-rattr-0 do:
     1140     if lookup( last-event :function, "MOUSE-SELECT-DBLCLICK,RETURN" ) = 0 and last-event :label <> "CTRL-J" then do:
     1141       assign FoundRec = ?
